 --------------------------------------
|            Beluga Caviar             |
| A Type-preserving Compiler in Beluga |
 --------------------------------------
as described in "Programming type safe transformations using higher-order abstract syntax"

cps.bel     : Continuation-passing style transformation over STLC
sfcps.bel   : CPS over System F
cc.bel      : Closure conversion over STLC
cchoist.bel : Closure conversion and hoisting over STLC

Beluga is available online at http://complogic.cs.mcgill.ca/beluga/

To run, execute
|> beluga [filename]

We recommend to run examples with
|> beluga -implicit [filename]
to avoid implicit type arguments to term constructors to be printed.


